    "reviews": "\u201cCard Quest takes cats as the theme and combines innovative card gameplay. It emphasizes both cuteness and strategy. A must-play for tough guys!\u201d<br>\u9876\u7ea7\u73a9\u5bb6TOPGAMER<br><br>\u201cUndoubtedly the art style is the most eye-catching part of Card Quest. What's even more impressive is that both the art and the fragmented storylines are continuously injecting fairytale-like brightness into the dark world, as if kindling a warm candlelight in the deep of the night.\u201d<br>\u6e38\u620f\u827a\u672f\u5bb6GameArt<br>",
